796\">7040A10</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3025612\">5580C22</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3025795\">7040A09</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3025801\">7040A31</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3025391\">5010C12</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3025403\">5010D56</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3025591\">5560B56</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3025590\">5560B11</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3025570\">5550A12</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3025799\">7040A26</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3025282\">4110A11</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3025611\">5580C18</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3025802\">7040A37</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3025613\">5580C26</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3025444\">5040D18</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3025597\">5570T80</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3025804\">7040A80</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3025833\">7040L20</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3025278\">3380A44</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3025803\">7040A65</a> (left\nand right sides)</p><p>Repressurize using coolant fluid (<a href=\"#/3025410\">5040A10</a> ).</p><p><a href=\"#/3024826\">1048A34</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3025915\">7055B54</a></p>"],[31,63,128,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"removing\" data-part=\"removal\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"refitting\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</a><p><a href=\"#/3025915\">7055B54</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3024826\">1048A34</a></p><p>Drain the coolant (<a href=\"#/3025410\">5040A10</a> ).</p><p><a href=\"#/3025840\">7045A10</a> (left\nand right sides)</p><p><a href=\"#/3025803\">7040A65</a> (left\nand right sides)</p><p><a href=\"#/3025278\">3380A44</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3025833\">7040L20</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3025804\">7040A80</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3025597\">5570T80</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3025444\">5040D18</a></p><aside class=\"note\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/768.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2000166.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th colspan=\"1\"><asi